    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Story Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a yacht accident, you and your guests are stranded on a mysterious island. Will you survive alone or help everyone pull through together? The game blends romance, survival, crafting, farming, fishing, pet taming, and more\u2014promising a unique survival adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast island map featuring caves, abandoned structures, cliffs, and other special locations. With ultra-high vegetation density, nearly every environmental object can be gathered, each holding unique value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge bonds with NPCs through a comprehensive affinity system. Each NPC features authentic voice acting to enhance immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent NPCs capable of independent eating, cooking, resting, gathering, and combat. They dynamically adjust behavior based on player status, offering care and emotional interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple NPC outfits unlockable through affinity progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes all core survival elements: base building, farming, pet hatching, pet rearing, armor/weapon crafting, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse creatures (monsters) with designated habitats\u2014each engages in <i>all-terrain combat</i>. Fully open-world exploration with zero player restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive weapon variety: combat tools (axes, bows, spears, crossbows, firearms) and non-combat tools (shovels, sickles, bamboo tubes).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully open-ended gameplay\u2014explore both land and underwater realms.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Custom Surviv